        "headline": "Meet The Practitioner",
        "large_headline": "Dr. Christie",
        "copy": "<p>Dr. Christie Prendergast is a double-board certified plastic surgeon and precision medicine specialist redefining the intersection of health, beauty, and longevity through highly personalized, patient-centered care. Her approach focuses on optimization, maintenance, and disease prevention—blending aesthetic artistry with scientific precision.</p><p>Raised between Asia, Europe, and the United States, Dr. Christie’s global perspective on beauty was shaped by diverse cultural influences and personal experiences. Early in her surgical career, she recognized that conventional, standardized approaches to aesthetics often lacked innovation, inclusivity, and individual nuance. This insight led her to explore a more integrative path—one that embraces the full spectrum of aging, from cellular health to external refinement.</p><p>Driven by her passion for healthspan and longevity science, Dr. Christie integrates plastic surgery, regenerative aesthetics, and precision medicine into a singular, cohesive practice. By combining advanced diagnostics, metabolic and genetic insights, individualized nutrition, and lifestyle optimization, she empowers her patients to take control of their health, enhance their natural beauty, and age with intention and integrity.</p>",
