      "settings": {
        "headline": "About",
        "large_headline": "Beauty Matrix®",
        "copy": "<p>Developed by Dr. Christie, the Beauty Matrix<strong>®</strong> is an aesthetic methodology that merges cutting-edge technology, biological data, and clinical expertise to deliver refined, personalized outcomes. Grounded in science and built for long-term impact, it redefines how we approach aesthetic aging.<br/><br/>Designed as a multi-modal strategy, the Beauty Matrix® targets the full spectrum of aging – from skin, hair, and physique to the cellular mechanisms that drive them. By prioritizing optimization, maintenance and early intervention, it enhances natural beauty while minimizing the reliance on invasive procedures over time.<br/><br/>Each Beauty Matrix® journey begins with a comprehensive clinical assessment, integrating advanced imaging and diagnostic tools to measure key markers of skin health and biological aging. This data creates a dynamic framework that is used to craft an individualized plan, combining regenerative procedures, advanced technologies, and targeted therapeutics to restore skin quality, natural volume, improve laxity and support graceful aging.<br/><br/>At its core, the Beauty Matrix® is rooted in innovation, customization, and a commitment to longevity, offering a seamless, results-driven path toward aesthetic goals that evolve with you.</p>",
