      "settings": {
        "headline": "About",
        "large_headline": "QoL Program",
        "copy": "<p>Dr. Christie’s QoL (Quality of Life) Program is an evidence-based precision medicine model that redefines quality of life as a core metric of healthspan and longevity.<br/><br/>The QoL Program integrates allopathic and osteopathic care with nutrition, genetics, and lifestyle science to address the complex, individualized factors driving both internal and external aging.<br/><br/>Designed to uncover and treat the root causes of aging, the program utilizes advanced diagnostics, comprehensive clinical assessments, and biological analytics to inform highly personalized, results-driven strategies.<br/><br/>Our treatment protocols are crafted not only to optimize health and aesthetic outcomes, but also enhance and support the regenerative systems that sustain them.</p>",
